{"steam_appid":2459550,"steam_name":"Emberward","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2459550/1923989298/946ab20732a30ea40393b01e6f74d251cca3da3c/1789813586/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1789814006","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257076640/af1e3b51042af6ee9c63d717788709042687c8ce/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1789814006","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/80b9f622576d1c9ccfef45c57f1504378215c90d/ss_80b9f622576d1c9ccfef45c57f1504378215c90d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790056350","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/ss_4861d31990950a67a1797beadecb90b1cd79e22c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790056350","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/8011ef6ab4cfa1679bb3ded1e990f58e325ffdeb/ss_8011ef6ab4cfa1679bb3ded1e990f58e325ffdeb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790056350","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/28bd980ebd627c40fa6ad2e4fa2af2a7471543d0/ss_28bd980ebd627c40fa6ad2e4fa2af2a7471543d0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790056350","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/ss_1e69187064214f0881242624f2833a9bb909179f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790056350"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/5dcf6efe55ac20639ecd22a397622bd0.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/5dcf6efe55ac20639ecd22a397622bd0.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/109755567b52c9fad2426d67f5f3ff38.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a maze before the battle begins! Be creative and find the best setup with the block cards in your hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of your limited wall blocks! Will you make the monsters take a longer route, or will you use the blocks to position your towers more strategically?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the battle, add various runes to the block cards! Runes can enhance your towers, grant blocks special abilities, or even double their size!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/6feab34b0f30c23535d487d876e47aef.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/6feab34b0f30c23535d487d876e47aef.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/772a3bdbbbb624930d5536251feec06e.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/772a3bdbbbb624930d5536251feec06e.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/772a3bdbbbb624930d5536251feec06e.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower with various sizes</strong>: 1x3? 2x2? 3x3? Building powerful towers requires careful planning!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poison Towers that Span Monster Paths</strong>: Instead of shooting, we pour poison directly on the enemies' heads!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drone Towers that Track Enemies</strong>: Why wait for enemies to come? Attack is the best form of defence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D20 Towers that Test Your Luck</strong>: Higher number equals higher damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(...and a lot more!!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/26e8c26d86dcd9b3a3e121e1699e9a74.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/26e8c26d86dcd9b3a3e121e1699e9a74.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/a858fc1dfe5fbe11a671c1ced86ea7b7.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/a858fc1dfe5fbe11a671c1ced86ea7b7.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/a858fc1dfe5fbe11a671c1ced86ea7b7.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character and flame before starting your adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique with different maps, tower compositions, and mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new towers, block cards, or power relics during your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle grants you experience. Learn from various talents and become stronger for your next adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/fa8337bcc41fe497f7be3a992c0ab511.avif?t=1790056350\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras_big/fa8337bcc41fe497f7be3a992c0ab511.webp?t=1790056350 width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/11b0a0f01e0d0a753135c0118b48a1ec.poster.avif?t=1790056350\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/11b0a0f01e0d0a753135c0118b48a1ec.webm?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2459550/extras/11b0a0f01e0d0a753135c0118b48a1ec.mp4?t=1790056350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode:</strong> Fight through a series of stages and take on powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Play special event maps and over 80 stages while competing for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enigma Sanctum:</strong> A fast-paced game mode where you build the strongest defense with a limited set of cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB GPU Memory, capable of OpenGL 3.0+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Strategy","Free To Play"],"developers":["Refic Games"],"publishers":["Refic Games"],"release_date":"Sep 17, 2026"}